{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 12,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 474.856,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after the space of two years",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.709,
      "end": 6.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that Abinadi came among them in disguise,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.583,
      "end": 8.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they knew him not,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.713,
      "end": 11.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to prophesy among them, saying:",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.447,
      "end": 13.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus has the Lord commanded me, saying\u2014",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 13.903,
      "end": 16.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Abinadi, go and prophesy unto this my people,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 17.055,
      "end": 20.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they have hardened their hearts against my words;",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 20.532,
      "end": 23.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they have repented not of their evil doings;",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 23.498,
      "end": 25.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, I will visit them in my anger,",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 25.954,
      "end": 31.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, in my fierce anger will I visit them in their iniquities and abominations.",
      "verse": "12:1",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 32.393,
      "end": 34.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, wo be unto this generation!",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.663,
      "end": 36.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord said unto me:",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 36.561,
      "end": 39.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Stretch forth thy hand and prophesy, saying:",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 39.852,
      "end": 41.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus saith the Lord,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 41.518,
      "end": 46.208,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it shall come to pass that this generation, because of their iniquities,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 46.388,
      "end": 48.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be brought into bondage,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 48.658,
      "end": 51.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall be smitten on the cheek; yea,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 51.578,
      "end": 54.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall be driven by men, and shall be slain;",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 54.916,
      "end": 57.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the vultures of the air, and the dogs,",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 57.697,
      "end": 60.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and the wild beasts, shall devour their flesh.",
      "verse": "12:2",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 61.674,
      "end": 66.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that the life of king Noah shall be valued",
      "verse": "12:3",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 66.312,
      "end": 68.68,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as a garment in a hot furnace;",
      "verse": "12:3",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 68.86,
      "end": 71.089,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he shall know that I am the Lord.",
      "verse": "12:3",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 71.769,
      "end": 76.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that I will smite this my people with sore afflictions,",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 76.732,
      "end": 79.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, with famine and with pestilence;",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 79.606,
      "end": 82.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will cause that they shall howl all the day long.",
      "verse": "12:4",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 83.676,
      "end": 88.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and I will cause that they shall have burdens lashed upon their backs;",
      "verse": "12:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 88.639,
      "end": 91.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall be driven before like a dumb ass.",
      "verse": "12:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 92.477,
      "end": 96.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that I will send forth hail among them,",
      "verse": "12:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 96.372,
      "end": 97.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it shall smite them;",
      "verse": "12:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 98.177,
      "end": 101.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall also be smitten with the east wind;",
      "verse": "12:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 101.422,
      "end": 104.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and insects shall pester their land also,",
      "verse": "12:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 104.249,
      "end": 105.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and devour their grain.",
      "verse": "12:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 106.647,
      "end": 109.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they shall be smitten with a great pestilence\u2014",
      "verse": "12:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 109.799,
      "end": 114.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all this will I do because of their iniquities and abominations.",
      "verse": "12:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 115.262,
      "end": 118.42,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass that except they repent",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 118.6,
      "end": 121.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will utterly destroy them from off the face of the earth;",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 122.077,
      "end": 124.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet they shall leave a record behind them,",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 124.904,
      "end": 129.455,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will preserve them for other nations which shall possess the land;",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 129.635,
      "end": 131.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even this will I do",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 131.626,
      "end": 136.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may discover the abominations of this people to other nations.",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 136.45,
      "end": 140.072,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And many things did Abinadi prophesy against this people.",
      "verse": "12:8",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 140.752,
      "end": 144.096,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they were angry with him;",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 144.276,
      "end": 147.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they took him and carried him bound before the king,",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 147.335,
      "end": 148.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto the king:",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 149.048,
      "end": 151.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we have brought a man before thee",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 151.875,
      "end": 154.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who has prophesied evil concerning thy people,",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 155.12,
      "end": 157.07,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and saith that God will destroy them.",
      "verse": "12:9",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 157.75,
      "end": 161.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also prophesieth evil concerning thy life,",
      "verse": "12:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 161.227,
      "end": 165.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and saith that thy life shall be as a garment in a furnace of fire.",
      "verse": "12:10",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 166.551,
      "end": 169.848,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, he saith that thou shalt be as a stalk,",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 170.028,
      "end": 172.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as a dry stalk of the field,",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 172.437,
      "end": 175.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is run over by the beasts and trodden under foot.",
      "verse": "12:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 176.646,
      "end": 181.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, he saith thou shalt be as the blossoms of a thistle,",
      "verse": "12:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 181.377,
      "end": 184.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which, when it is fully ripe, if the wind bloweth,",
      "verse": "12:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 184.715,
      "end": 187.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it is driven forth upon the face of the land.",
      "verse": "12:12",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 187.728,
      "end": 190.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he pretendeth the Lord hath spoken it.",
      "verse": "12:12",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 190.23,
      "end": 193.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he saith all this shall come upon thee except thou repent,",
      "verse": "12:12",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 193.754,
      "end": 195.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because of thine iniquities.",
      "verse": "12:12",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 196.524,
      "end": 197.871,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, O king,",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 198.051,
      "end": 200.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what great evil hast thou done,",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 200.367,
      "end": 203.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or what great sins have thy people committed,",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 203.566,
      "end": 206.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we should be condemned of God or judged of this man?",
      "verse": "12:13",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 207.357,
      "end": 208.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, O king,",
      "verse": "12:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 208.884,
      "end": 210.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, we are guiltless,",
      "verse": "12:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 210.829,
      "end": 213.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou, O king, hast not sinned;",
      "verse": "12:14",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 213.331,
      "end": 216.303,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, this man has lied concerning you,",
      "verse": "12:14",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 216.483,
      "end": 218.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he has prophesied in vain.",
      "verse": "12:14",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 219.113,
      "end": 220.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, we are strong,",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 221.104,
      "end": 225.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we shall not come into bondage, or be taken captive by our enemies;",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 225.742,
      "end": 228.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and thou hast prospered in the land,",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 228.337,
      "end": 230.334,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou shalt also prosper.",
      "verse": "12:15",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 231.014,
      "end": 232.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, here is the man,",
      "verse": "12:16",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 232.959,
      "end": 235.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we deliver him into thy hands;",
      "verse": "12:16",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 235.275,
      "end": 238.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou mayest do with him as seemeth thee good.",
      "verse": "12:16",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 239.02,
      "end": 244.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that king Noah caused that Abinadi should be cast into prison;",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 244.541,
      "end": 248.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he commanded that the priests should gather themselves together",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 248.529,
      "end": 252.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might hold a council with them what he should do with him.",
      "verse": "12:17",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 253.203,
      "end": 255.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they said unto the king:",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 256.077,
      "end": 258.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Bring him hither that we may question him;",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 258.625,
      "end": 261.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the king commanded that he should be brought before them.",
      "verse": "12:18",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 262.37,
      "end": 264.646,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they began to question him,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 264.826,
      "end": 266.73,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might cross him,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 266.91,
      "end": 270.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they might have wherewith to accuse him;",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 270.573,
      "end": 272.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he answered them boldly,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 272.657,
      "end": 275.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and withstood all their questions,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 275.345,
      "end": 277.156,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, to their astonishment;",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 277.336,
      "end": 280.54,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he did withstand them in all their questions,",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 280.72,
      "end": 283.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did confound them in all their words.",
      "verse": "12:19",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 284.047,
      "end": 287.298,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that one of them said unto him:",
      "verse": "12:20",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 287.478,
      "end": 289.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What meaneth the words which are written,",
      "verse": "12:20",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 290.166,
      "end": 293.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and which have been taught by our fathers, saying:",
      "verse": "12:20",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 294.097,
      "end": 296.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How beautiful upon the mountains",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 296.599,
      "end": 299.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are the feet of him that bringeth good tidings;",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 299.705,
      "end": 301.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that publisheth peace;",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 301.51,
      "end": 303.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that bringeth good tidings of good;",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 304.012,
      "end": 306.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that publisheth salvation;",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 306.189,
      "end": 307.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that saith unto Zion,",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 307.994,
      "end": 309.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thy God reigneth;",
      "verse": "12:21",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 310.114,
      "end": 312.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thy watchmen shall lift up the voice;",
      "verse": "12:22",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 312.755,
      "end": 315.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with the voice together shall they sing;",
      "verse": "12:22",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 315.303,
      "end": 317.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall see eye to eye",
      "verse": "12:22",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 317.666,
      "end": 319.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when the Lord shall bring again Zion;",
      "verse": "12:22",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 320.668,
      "end": 322.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Break forth into joy;",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 322.473,
      "end": 323.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "sing together",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 324.046,
      "end": 326.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye waste places of Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 326.316,
      "end": 328.777,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord hath comforted his people,",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 328.957,
      "end": 330.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he hath redeemed Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "12:23",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 331.262,
      "end": 335.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The Lord hath made bare his holy arm in the eyes of all the nations,",
      "verse": "12:24",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 335.854,
      "end": 337.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all the ends of the earth",
      "verse": "12:24",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 338.17,
      "end": 340.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall see the salvation of our God?",
      "verse": "12:24",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 341.265,
      "end": 343.355,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now Abinadi said unto them:",
      "verse": "12:25",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 343.535,
      "end": 344.975,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Are you priests,",
      "verse": "12:25",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 345.155,
      "end": 347.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and pretend to teach this people,",
      "verse": "12:25",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 347.564,
      "end": 350.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to understand the spirit of prophesying,",
      "verse": "12:25",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 350.577,
      "end": 353.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and yet desire to know of me what these things mean?",
      "verse": "12:25",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 354.322,
      "end": 355.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "12:26",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 355.988,
      "end": 359.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wo be unto you for perverting the ways of the Lord!",
      "verse": "12:26",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 359.558,
      "end": 363.041,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For if ye understand these things ye have not taught them;",
      "verse": "12:26",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 363.221,
      "end": 366.193,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, ye have perverted the ways of the Lord.",
      "verse": "12:26",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 366.873,
      "end": 369.706,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye have not applied your hearts to understanding;",
      "verse": "12:27",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 369.886,
      "end": 371.976,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, ye have not been wise.",
      "verse": "12:27",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 372.156,
      "end": 374.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, what teach ye this people?",
      "verse": "12:27",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 374.972,
      "end": 376.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they said:",
      "verse": "12:28",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 376.638,
      "end": 378.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "We teach the law of Moses.",
      "verse": "12:28",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 379.129,
      "end": 381.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again he said unto them:",
      "verse": "12:29",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 381.213,
      "end": 384.232,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If ye teach the law of Moses why do ye not keep it?",
      "verse": "12:29",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 384.412,
      "end": 386.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Why do ye set your hearts upon riches?",
      "verse": "12:29",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 386.868,
      "end": 390.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Why do ye commit whoredoms and spend your strength with harlots,",
      "verse": "12:29",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 390.577,
      "end": 393.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and cause this people to commit sin,",
      "verse": "12:29",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 393.265,
      "end": 397.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord has cause to send me to prophesy against this people,",
      "verse": "12:29",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 397.578,
      "end": 400.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even a great evil against this people?",
      "verse": "12:29",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 400.998,
      "end": 403.227,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Know ye not that I speak the truth?",
      "verse": "12:30",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 403.407,
      "end": 405.775,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, ye know that I speak the truth;",
      "verse": "12:30",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 405.955,
      "end": 407.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and you ought to tremble before God.",
      "verse": "12:30",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 408.632,
      "end": 410.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it shall come to pass",
      "verse": "12:31",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 410.67,
      "end": 413.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall be smitten for your iniquities,",
      "verse": "12:31",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 413.404,
      "end": 416.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye have said that ye teach the law of Moses.",
      "verse": "12:31",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 416.231,
      "end": 418.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And what know ye concerning the law of Moses?",
      "verse": "12:31",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 418.965,
      "end": 421.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Doth salvation come by the law of Moses?",
      "verse": "12:31",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 421.56,
      "end": 422.721,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What say ye?",
      "verse": "12:31",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 423.401,
      "end": 427.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they answered and said that salvation did come by the law of Moses.",
      "verse": "12:32",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 427.936,
      "end": 430.119,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But now Abinadi said unto them:",
      "verse": "12:33",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 430.299,
      "end": 433.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I know if ye keep the commandments of God ye shall be saved;",
      "verse": "12:33",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 434.148,
      "end": 436.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, if ye keep the commandments",
      "verse": "12:33",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 436.325,
      "end": 440.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which the Lord delivered unto Moses in the mount of Sinai, saying:",
      "verse": "12:33",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 441.185,
      "end": 442.903,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I am the Lord thy God,",
      "verse": "12:34",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 443.083,
      "end": 447.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who hath brought thee out of the land of Egypt, out of the house of bondage.",
      "verse": "12:34",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 447.803,
      "end": 450.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt have no other God before me.",
      "verse": "12:35",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 450.898,
      "end": 453.87,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thou shalt not make unto thee any graven image,",
      "verse": "12:36",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 454.05,
      "end": 456.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or any likeness of any thing in heaven above,",
      "verse": "12:36",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 457.063,
      "end": 459.617,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or things which are in the earth beneath.",
      "verse": "12:36",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 460.297,
      "end": 462.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Abinadi said unto them,",
      "verse": "12:37",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 462.195,
      "end": 463.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Have ye done all this?",
      "verse": "12:37",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 463.908,
      "end": 465.394,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "12:37",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 465.574,
      "end": 467.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nay, ye have not.",
      "verse": "12:37",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 467.24,
      "end": 470.862,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And have ye taught this people that they should do all these things?",
      "verse": "12:37",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 471.042,
      "end": 472.528,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto you,",
      "verse": "12:37",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 472.708,
      "end": 474.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nay, ye have not.",
      "verse": "12:37",
      "lineIndex": 163
    }
  ]
}